  .flow-table {\n    margin: 16px 0 10px 36px;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: calc(100% - 36px);\n    max-width: 560px;\n  }\n\n  .flow-table th,\n  .flow-table td {\n    border: 1.5px solid #999;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .flow-table th {\n    background: #888;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  .flow-table td {\n    background: #f0f0f0;\n    color: #333;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  .flow-table td:first-child {\n    background: #f0f0f0;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <h1>家庭净水器选购指南</h1>\n  <div class=\"subtitle\">@吃货万万岁</div>\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">\n      <span class=\"check-icon\">✔</span>\n      <h2>1.选RO反渗透净水器，别选超滤净水器</h2>\n    </div>\n    <p>超滤膜过滤精度只有0.01微米，而RO膜是0.0001微米。差距是100倍！所以一定要选RO反渗透！</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">\n      <span class=\"check-icon\">✔</span>\n      <h2>2.通量选大于800G的</h2>\n    </div>\n    <p>通量决定了出水速度，出水速度大后，净水器就不光可以饮水，还可以洗碗、洗水果、煲汤等</p>\n    <table class=\"flow-table\">\n      <tr>\n        <th>通量</th>\n        <th>400G</th>\n        <th>600G</th>\n        <th>800G</th>\n        <th>1000G</th>\n        <th>1200G</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>出水速度</td>\n        <td>1L/min</td>\n        <td>1.5L/min</td>\n        <td>2L/min</td>\n        <td>2.5L/min</td>\n        <td>3L/min</td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">\n      <span class=\"check-icon\">✔</span>\n      <h2>3.最好选0添加0阻垢剂0陈水的</h2>\n    </div>\n    <p>阻垢剂并不能增强滤芯的过滤性能，也不能改善纯水的水质。同时，阻垢剂中的含磷物质还会造成水体营养化，所以尽量选择0阻垢剂的净水器；0陈水的意思，就是不会储水。这样我们就不会喝 到隔夜水了～每天清晨的第一杯水不需要倒掉。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">\n      <span class=\"check-icon\">✔</span>\n      <h2>4.空间小选无桶，预算低选有桶</h2>\n    </div>\n    <p>净水器有桶无桶其实都可以！有桶也不会造成细菌污染（都是无桶商家踩出来的）。所以，你根据实际场景选！空间小选无桶，预算低选有桶。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
